### Is mobile app security necessary on all platforms?

Mobile application threats exist on both Android and iOS. A common [misconception](https://www.guardsquare.com/video/misconceptions-about-ios-mobile-app-security) is that iOS inherently is more secure than Android. Though there are certainly differences between Android and iOS with respect to security considerations and level of difficulty to reverse engineer, the bottom line is that a skilled person with the right knowledge of reverse engineering and tampering can accomplish many of the same goals with apps on the iOS platform.

